{"title":"1993 IMO Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/0/810e460dffbcdc2f82179a0d133fe713ffb37b59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathbb{N} = \\{1,2,3, \\ldots\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"127\" height=\"18\" />. Determine if there exists a strictly increasing function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/f/b7f1bf0857c3653bcc5aca23222a58953c57422e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f: \\mathbb{N} \\mapsto \\mathbb{N}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"79\" height=\"16\" /> with the following properties:\n</p><p>(i) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/e/ebe113a800b519c0a4b80803d4fa2be2546015f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1) = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" />;\n</p><p>(ii) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/c/c0cc3de5a3f0e56efd91cbce409ee83935477668.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(f(n)) = f(n) + n, (n \\in \\mathbb{N})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"221\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Here is my Solution <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/q2h62193p16226748\">https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/q2h62193p16226748</a>\n</p><p>Find as ≈ Ftheftics\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_solution\">Video solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/IfCBp0608p8\">https://youtu.be/IfCBp0608p8</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_IMO_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center